t. Ltd. issued by Hyderabad Water Supply Board for December 2025 totaling INR 158,733.62.","doc_type":"water_bill","pipeline":"improved","segments":[{"text":"WATER SUPPLY                            WATER BILL\nAUTHORITY                                     INVOICE\n\n\nHyderabad Water Supply                                                                 Contact: +91-40-2329 8000\nBoard Telangana, India                                                                 Email: billing@hwsb.telangana.gov.in\n\n\n BILL TO:                                            SHIP TO:\n\n Name: Coca-Cola Beverages India Pvt. Ltd.                  Name: Coca-Cola Beverages India Pvt. Ltd.\n\n Street Address: Manjira Industrial Area, Survey No. 45-52         Street Address: Manjira Industrial Area, Survey No. 45-52\n\n  City, State: Hyderabad, Telangana                                       City, State: Hyderabad, Telangana\n\n ZIP Code: 501505 | Phone: +91-40-2329 5000 |                 ZIP Code: 501505 | Phone: +91-40-2329 5000\n Email: operations@cocacolaindia.com\n\n\n\n\n Invoice Number:                                 HYD-WB-2025-12-001\n\n Invoice Date:                                         31st December 2025\n\n Billing Period:                                        01st December 2025 to 31st December 2025\n\n Due Date:                                          15th January 2026\n\n\n\nMETER DETAILS:\n\n Meter Number:                                 MTR-COCA-HYD-001\n\n Meter Size:                                     50 mm Digital Water Meter\n\n Previous Reading (01-12-2025):                      12,500 Cubic Meters\n\n Current Reading (31-12-2025):                       14,821 Cubic Meters\n\n Units Consumed (December 2025):                   2,321 Cubic Meters\n\n\n\nBILLING BREAKDOWN:\n\n      Description                Unit Rate              Quantity/Units          Amount (INR)\n\n Water Supply Charges                      ₹45.50/Cu.M                        2,321                   105,605.50\n  (Industrial)\n\n Fixed Meter Charges                           ₹500.00                        1                      500.00\n (Monthly)\n\n Sewerage Charges (50%                    ₹22.75/Cu.M                        1,160.5                    26,401.38\n of water)\n\n Water Quality Surcharge                     ₹5.00/Cu.M                        2,321                    11,605.00\n\n Environmental Cess                         ₹3.00/Cu.M                        2,321                      6,963.00","cells":null,"locator":{"page":1,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"ordinal":0,"scanned":false},{"text":"Processing Fee                                ₹100.00                        1                      100.00\n\n Subtotal:                                        ₹0.00                        0    ₹151,174.88\n\n\n\n Subtotal:                                       ₹151,174.88\n\n Tax (5% GST):                                   ₹7,558.74\n\n TOTAL AMOUNT DUE:                           ₹158,733.62\n\n Payment Status:                           PENDING\n\n\n\nPAYMENT TERMS & CONDITIONS:\n\n• Payment due within 15 days from invoice date\n• Late payment attracts interest @ 2% per month\n\n• Water supply will be disconnected if payment is not received within 30 days\n\n• GST @ 5% is included in the total amount\n\n• All amounts are in Indian Rupees (INR)\n\n\n\n\nPAYMENT DETAILS:\n\n Bank Name:                                      Hyderabad Central Bank\n\n Account Number:                               4587962100001234\n\n IFSC Code:                                    HCBK0000458\n\n Account Holder:                                   Hyderabad Water Supply Board\n\n\n\nNOTES:\n\n1. This is an electronically generated invoice. No signature required.\n\n2. For meter reading disputes or billing inquiries, contact:\n\nbilling@hwsb.telangana.gov.in 3. Please refer to Invoice Number in all correspondence.\n\n4. Ensure timely payment to avoid water supply disconnection.\n\n5. Industrial consumers are eligible for rebate on recycled water usage.","cells":null,"locator":{"page":2,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"ordinal":1,"scanned":false},{"text":"Hyderabad Water Supply Board | Authorized Signatory | Thank you for your business","cells":null,"locator":{"page":3,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"ordinal":2,"scanned":false}],"page_count":3,"period_end":"2025-12-31","organisation":"Coca-Cola Beverages India Pvt. Ltd.","period_start":"2025-12-01"},"attempts":1,"pipeline":"improved","file_hash":"0d77a75093e4c5ffb972dfa4b65d3bf17e2ca0907fa038ed62791a9f8c5cf739","extraction_prompt_hash":"3b85e711ee5bc54841a4794bd4a8a729b12207a1fedb9110292032fda1d615a3"},"quality_policy_nestle.pdf":{"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","status":"succeeded","content":{"facts":[{"key":"issuing_department","note":null,"unit":null,"label":"Issuing department","quote":"Issuing department\nCorporate Quality Management","metric":null,"origin":"reported","series":null,"locator":{"page":2,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"category":"party","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":null,"value_text":"Corporate Quality Management","period_start":null,"value_number":null,"verification":"Quote found on p.2"},{"key":"target_audience","note":null,"unit":null,"label":"Target audience","quote":"Target audience\nAll employees","metric":null,"origin":"reported","series":null,"locator":{"page":2,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"category":"scope","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":null,"value_text":"All employees","period_start":null,"value_number":null,"verification":"Quote found on p.2"},{"key":"approver","note":null,"unit":null,"label":"Approver","quote":"Approver\nExecutive Board, Nestlé S.A.","metric":null,"origin":"reported","series":null,"locator":{"page":2,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"category":"party","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":null,"value_text":"Executive Board, Nestlé S.A.","period_start":null,"value_number":null,"verification":"Qu