ll,"value_text":"We never compromise on food safety and compliance. We adhere to internationally recognized food safety management systems and comply with legal, regulatory, and internal requirements.","period_start":null,"value_number":null,"verification":"Quote not found on p.3"},{"key":"commitment_product_superiority","note":null,"unit":null,"label":"Commitment: Quality enables Unrivaled Product Superiority","quote":"quality is the cornerstone of our ambition to achieve unrivaled product superiority. We take ownership, make deliberate choices, and aim to deliver the best consumer and customer experience","metric":null,"origin":"reported","series":null,"locator":{"page":3,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"category":"commitment","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":null,"value_text":"quality is the cornerstone of our ambition to achieve unrivaled product superiority. We take ownership, make deliberate choices, and aim to deliver the best consumer and customer experience","period_start":null,"value_number":null,"verification":"Quote found on p.3"},{"key":"commitment_end_to_end_quality","note":null,"unit":null,"label":"Commitment: Quality is End-to-End","quote":"Quality is embedded across the entire value chain, from ideation to responsibly sourced ingredients, manufacturing, packaging, and delivery to the point of consumption.","metric":null,"origin":"reported","series":null,"locator":{"page":3,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"category":"commitment","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":null,"value_text":"Quality is embedded across the entire value chain, from ideation to responsibly sourced ingredients, manufacturing, packaging, and delivery to the point of consumption.","period_start":null,"value_number":null,"verification":"Quote found on p.3"},{"key":"commitment_everyone_responsibility","note":null,"unit":null,"label":"Commitment: Food Safety and Quality are Everyone''s Responsibility","quote":"Each of us plays a vital role in delivering our promise of food safety and quality in the products we make.","metric":null,"origin":"reported","series":null,"locator":{"page":3,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"category":"commitment","verified":false,"derivation":null,"period_end":null,"value_text":"Each of us plays a vital role in delivering our promise of food safety and quality in the products we make.","period_start":null,"value_number":null,"verification":"Quote not found on p.3"},{"key":"signatory","note":null,"unit":null,"label":"Signatory","quote":"Philipp Navratil\nChief Executive Officer","metric":null,"origin":"reported","series":null,"locator":{"page":3,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"category":"party","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":null,"value_text":"Philipp Navratil, Chief Executive Officer","period_start":null,"value_number":null,"verification":"Quote found on p.3"},{"key":"document_organisation","note":null,"unit":null,"label":"Customer / organisation","quote":"Nestlé S.A.","metric":null,"origin":"reported","series":null,"locator":{"page":2,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"category":"party","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":null,"value_text":"Nestlé S.A.","period_start":null,"value_number":null,"verification":"Quote found on p.2"}],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","title":"Food Safety and Quality Policy","issuer":"Corporate Quality Management","issues":[],"summary":"This document outlines Nestlé''s Food Safety and Quality Policy, detailing commitments to food safety compliance, product superiority, and end-to-end quality management. It is issued by Corporate Quality Management and approved by the Executive Board of Nestlé S.A. in June 2026.","doc_type":"policy","pipeline":"improved","segments":[{"text":"Food Safety and\nQuality Policy\n\n\n\n\n\n         Po\n                                                                                          Policy\n                                                                      Mandatory\n\n                                                                           General Use","cells":null,"locator":{"page":1,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"ordinal":0,"scanned":false},{"text":"Issuing department\nCorporate Quality Management\n\nTarget audience\nAll employees\n\nApprover\nExecutive Board, Nestlé S.A.\n\nDate of approval\nJune 2026\n\nRepository\nAll Nestlé Principles and Policies, Standards and Guidelines\ncan be found in NestleDocs, on the Nest\n\nCopyright and confidentiality\nAll rights belong to Société des Produits Nestlé S.A., Vevey, Switzerland.\n© 2026, Société des Produits Nestlé S.A.\n\n\n\n\n\nDesign\nSociété des Produits Nestlé S.A., Corporate Identity & Design,\nVevey, Switzerland","cells":null,"locator":{"page":2,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"ordinal":1,"scanned":false},{"text":"Nestlé Food Safety and Quality Policy\n\n\n\n\n                  At Nestlé, Food Safety and Quality are at         Food Safety and Quality are Everyone’s\n                   the heart of everything we do. They are            Responsibility\n                   our foundation for trust and deeply rooted         Each of us plays a vital role in delivering\n                       in our purpose and values.                        our promise of food safety and quality in\n                                                                     the products we make. We foster a culture\n                Food Safety and Compliance are               where every individual is empowered and\n                 Non-Negotiable                                expected to act, speak up, drive continuous\n            We never compromise on food safety and        improvement - and is recognized for their\n                  compliance. We adhere to internationally           contributions.\n                   recognized food safety management systems\n                 and comply with legal, regulatory, and internal      With these commitments, we protect our\n                    requirements. Our commitment is unwavering:      consumers, safeguard our brands, and build\n                     to deliver safe and nutritious products that           trust. We all share the responsibility to take\n                   strengthen trust in our brands and our               action, raise the bar, execute with discipline\n                company - every day, in every market.              to guarantee food safety and quality in\n                                                                     everything we do.\n                   Quality enables Unrivaled Product\n                   Superiority\n                Powered by Nestlé’s long history of\n                    expertise and robust science and technology\n                      capabilities, quality is the cornerstone of\n                   our ambition to achieve unrivaled product\n                       superiority. We take ownership, make deliberate\n                    choices, and aim to deliver the best consumer\n                and customer experience, making sure that the\n                      quality we design is the quality we deliver.\n\n                   Quality is End-to-End\n                    Quality is embedded across the entire value\n                     chain, from ideation to responsibly sourced\n                    ingredients, manufacturing, packaging, and\n                     delivery to the point of consumption. At every\n                   phase, we ensure excellence in execution.\n\n\n\n\n\n                                                 On behalf of the Executive Team,\n\n\n\n\n\n                                                                         Philipp Navratil\n                                                                    Chief Executive Officer\n\n\n\n\n\nFood Safety and Quality Policy                                                                                                                          1","cells":null,"locator":{"page":3,"sheet":null,"cell_range":null},"ordinal":2,"scanned":false}],"page_count":3,"period_end":"2026-06-30","organisation":"Nestlé S.A.","period_start":"2026-06-01"},"attempts":1,"pipeline":"improved","file_hash":"cd838f7b5638afd19eaf794b86ddb526b5e156a2f62e977ea20af9107cd81261","extraction_prompt_hash":"b14b719afacb8eaeb9eb99027e89d573d5a7c191be8627e0989f0b2513fa2b09"},"Annual Electricity Consumption.xlsx":{"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","status":"succeeded","content":{"facts":[{"key":"grid_supply_kwh_january","note":null,"unit":"kWh","label":"Grid Supply (kWh) for January","quote":"132590","metric":"electricity","origin":"reported","series":"Grid Supply (kWh)","locator":{"page":null,"sheet":"Monthly Summary 2026","cell_range":"B3"},"category":"consumption","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":"2026-01-31","value_text":"132590","period_start":"2026-01-01","value_number":"132590.0","verification":"Value found in Monthly Summary 2026!B3"},{"key":"solar_power_kwh_january","note":null,"unit":"kWh","label":"Solar Power (kWh) for January","quote":"57965","metric":"electricity","origin":"reported","series":"Solar Power (kWh)","locator":{"page":null,"sheet":"Monthly Summary 2026","cell_range":"C3"},"category":"consumption","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":"2026-01-31","value_text":"57965","period_start":"2026-01-01","value_number":"57965.0","verification":"Value found in Monthly Summary 2026!C3"},{"key":"wind_power_kwh_january","note":null,"unit":"kWh","label":"Wind Power (kWh) for January","quote":"10268","metric":"electricity","origin":"reported","series":"Wind Power (kWh)","locator":{"page":null,"sheet":"Monthly Summary 2026","cell_range":"D3"},"category":"consumption","verified":true,"derivation":null,"period_end":"2026-01-31","value_text":"10268","period_start":"2026-01-01","value_number":"10268.0","verification":"Value found in Monthly Summary 2026!D3"},{"key":"total_renewable_kwh_january","note":null,"unit":"kWh","label":"Total Renewable (kWh) for January","quote":"68233","metric":"electricity","o